mobbattle.panel.field.battle.music.label = Battle music
mobbattle.panel.field.battle.music.tip = Music from the countdown to the end of the battle.
mobbattle.panel.field.battle.music.track.label = Music track
mobbattle.panel.field.battle.music.track.tip = Track used when battle music is on.
