mobbattle.panel.field.laser.enabled.tip = A laser between the fighters when a fight starts.
mobbattle.panel.field.laser.color.label = Laser color
mobbattle.panel.field.laser.color.tip = A palette color, or random (a new one each fight).
mobbattle.panel.field.fx.runes.label = Summoning runes
mobbattle.panel.field.fx.runes.tip = Runes on the ground during the countdown and rage marks at the start.
mobbattle.panel.field.fight.camera.label = Intro camera
mobbattle.panel.field.fight.camera.tip = Camera shots of the fighters during the countdown.
mobbattle.panel.field.camera.style.label = Camera style
mobbattle.panel.field.camera.style.tip = auto = duel shots for duels, focus for all vs one, sweep for teams, orbit for royale.
mobbattle.panel.field.camera.time.label = Camera time
mobbattle.panel.field.camera.time.tip = How long the intro camera films.
mobbattle.panel.field.camera.time.hint = seconds, 0 = as long as the countdown
mobbattle.panel.field.camera.shots.label = Showcase shots
mobbattle.panel.field.camera.shots.tip = How many fighters the showcase style shows.
mobbattle.panel.field.camera.shots.hint = fighters shown (up to Max mobs)
mobbattle.panel.field.camera.scope.label = Who sees the cameras
mobbattle.panel.field.camera.scope.tip = owner, players nearby (64 blocks) or the whole world. Fighters never get an intro.
mobbattle.panel.field.camera.end.label = End camera
mobbattle.panel.field.camera.end.tip = Film the winner or who landed the last hit when a battle ends.
mobbattle.panel.field.camera.end.time.label = End camera time
mobbattle.panel.field.camera.end.time.tip = How long the end camera films.
mobbattle.panel.field.camera.end.time.hint = seconds
mobbattle.panel.field.camera.autowatch.label = Auto watch
mobbattle.panel.field.camera.autowatch.tip = Camera viewers start watching (spectator camera) as soon as a battle starts.
mobbattle.panel.field.battle.duelcard.label = Duel card
mobbattle.panel.field.battle.duelcard.tip = Card with both fighters' stats during 1 vs 1 duels, on the right; it replaces the duel scoreboard.
mobbattle.panel.field.battle.focuscard.label = All vs one card
mobbattle.panel.field.battle.focuscard.tip = Card with the lone target's stats and the attackers left (health, top damage dealer), on the right; it replaces the all vs one scoreboard. Default off.
mobbattle.panel.field.battle.pvp.label = Battle PvP
mobbattle.panel.field.battle.pvp.tip = Enemy players of the same battle can hurt each other even where the world's PvP is off.
mobbattle.panel.field.battle.unstick.label = Unstick stalled fighters
mobbattle.panel.field.battle.unstick.tip = A mob stuck on another level than its target (10 s, fliers 20 s) is moved next to it.
mobbattle.panel.field.battle.standoff.label = Stand-off shove
mobbattle.panel.field.battle.standoff.tip = A mob on its target's level that this long gets no closer, hits nothing and isn't hit is shoved toward it (default 15).
mobbattle.panel.field.battle.standoff.hint = seconds, 0 = never
mobbattle.panel.field.battle.passivewin.label = Win against passive mobs
mobbattle.panel.field.battle.passivewin.tip = When only one side can still fight back, it wins after this long without a hit (nobody can fight: a draw). An alert shows bottom left (default 15).
mobbattle.panel.field.battle.passivewin.hint = seconds, 0 = never
mobbattle.panel.field.battle.below.label = Battle depth (below)
mobbattle.panel.field.battle.below.tip = A royale or all vs one takes mobs only this far below its center (default 50; 0 = no limit, the whole area).
mobbattle.panel.field.battle.below.hint = blocks, 0 = no limit
mobbattle.panel.field.battle.above.label = Battle height (above)
mobbattle.panel.field.battle.above.tip = A royale or all vs one takes mobs only this far above its center (default 40; 0 = no limit).
mobbattle.panel.field.battle.above.hint = blocks, 0 = no limit
mobbattle.panel.field.battle.arena.vertical.label = Arena vertical limit
mobbattle.panel.field.battle.arena.vertical.tip = A fighter farther than this above or below the arena's center height (a cave shaft, a cliff) is brought back by the arena wall; fliers never (default 0 = no limit).
mobbattle.panel.field.battle.arena.vertical.hint = blocks, 0 = no limit
mobbattle.panel.field.battle.passivewin.ignore.label = Never ends against
mobbattle.panel.field.battle.passivewin.ignore.tip = Roles that keep a battle going while one is alive, e.g. a training dummy you test a mob against (default Test_Dummy*).
mobbattle.panel.field.battle.passivewin.ignore.hint = role ids, comma separated, * = any ending; empty = none
mobbattle.panel.field.battle.idleend.label = End when nobody fights
mobbattle.panel.field.battle.idleend.tip = A battle where no fighter hurts an enemy for this long ends in a draw (default 150 = 2.5 min).
mobbattle.panel.field.battle.idleend.hint = seconds, 0 = never
mobbattle.panel.field.battle.wave.travel.label = Reach as the ring arrives
mobbattle.panel.field.battle.wave.travel.tip = Snap: dust starts when the ring gets to each mob; royale and all vs one: each mob's mark comes with the ring. Default off.
mobbattle.panel.field.battle.wave.groundonly.label = Ground only
mobbattle.panel.field.battle.wave.groundonly.tip = Only mobs within 3 blocks above or below the wave are snapped or join: fliers and caves stay out. Default off.
mobbattle.panel.field.battle.timer.style.label = Timer box
mobbattle.panel.field.battle.timer.style.tip = custom = Mob Battle's timer box, portal = the game's portal timer.
mobbattle.panel.field.battle.arena.size.label = Arena size (duels, teams)
mobbattle.panel.field.battle.arena.size.tip = Radius of duel and team arenas.
mobbattle.panel.field.battle.arena.size.hint = blocks, 0 = auto (around the fighters), else {min}-{max}
mobbattle.panel.field.battle.shrink.to.label = Closing arena ends at
mobbattle.panel.field.battle.shrink.to.tip = Final radius of a closing arena.
mobbattle.panel.field.battle.shrink.to.hint = blocks
mobbattle.panel.field.battle.shrink.time.label = Closing time without timer
mobbattle.panel.field.battle.shrink.time.tip = How long a closing arena takes when its battle has no timer.
mobbattle.panel.field.battle.shrink.time.hint = seconds
mobbattle.panel.field.battle.tiebreak.label = Winner when even
mobbattle.panel.field.battle.tiebreak.tip = At time up, when the Judge by score is even: damage dealt, kills, a coin toss or a draw (default damage). If it is the same as Judge by (damage or kills), the other one is used.
mobbattle.panel.field.battle.killtiebreak.label = Kill table order
mobbattle.panel.field.battle.killtiebreak.tip = Fighters with the same kills: damage = more damage dealt first (default), alive = standing fighters first, first = who got there first, shared = they share the place. Then always who got there first.
