mobbattle.panel.field.duel.mode.tip = exclusive = a new duel replaces the old pair; accumulate = connected duels merge.
mobbattle.panel.field.battle.isolation.label = Isolated
mobbattle.panel.field.battle.isolation.tip = Its mobs only fight their opponents and outside NPCs can't hurt them.
mobbattle.panel.field.battle.selfdefense.label = Self defense
mobbattle.panel.field.battle.selfdefense.tip = A mob hit by an enemy that isn't its target turns on it (keeps it at least 3 s), like Army Wand mobs.
mobbattle.panel.field.battle.friendlyfire.label = Friendly fire
mobbattle.panel.field.battle.friendlyfire.tip = Hits between allies hurt (allies still never target each other).
mobbattle.panel.field.battle.players.label = Players can fight
mobbattle.panel.field.battle.players.duel.tip = Crouch + Battle Wand puts you in a duel.
mobbattle.panel.field.battle.players.allvsone.tip = /mobbattle chaos me: every mob around attacks you.
mobbattle.panel.field.battle.players.royale.tip = Players can be fighters in a royale.
mobbattle.panel.field.battle.players.teams.tip = /mobbattle teams join <team> puts you in a team.
mobbattle.panel.field.battle.arena.label = Arena
mobbattle.panel.field.battle.arena.tip = on = drawn + wall, show = only drawn, wall = invisible wall, off = none.
mobbattle.panel.field.battle.timer.label = Timer
mobbattle.panel.field.battle.timer.tip = Fight time limit with a timer box.
mobbattle.panel.field.battle.timer.hint = seconds, 0 = no time limit
