mobbattle.panel.field.battle.timeup.tip = draw, kill everyone, continue, health (the best score by Judge by wins) or judge (same, and the losers die). An even score goes to Winner when even (Ties, below).
mobbattle.panel.field.battle.judgeby.label = Judge by
mobbattle.panel.field.battle.judgeby.tip = What At time up health/judge scores: health % left (fallen = 0%), share of the damage or of the kills (per fighter, so a bigger side doesn't win for size), or mix (the three averaged). An even score goes to Winner when even (Ties, below).
mobbattle.panel.field.battle.shrink.label = Closing arena
mobbattle.panel.field.battle.shrink.tip = The arena closes in like a battle royale zone.
mobbattle.panel.field.battle.scoreboard.label = Scoreboard
mobbattle.panel.field.battle.scoreboard.tip = A row per side with fighters left and kills.
mobbattle.panel.field.chaos.area.label = Area look
mobbattle.panel.field.chaos.area.tip = What areas and arenas draw: border glow, disc on the ground, both, a wall, or nothing.
mobbattle.panel.field.chaos.radius.label = Area radius
mobbattle.panel.field.chaos.radius.tip = Mobs within this radius join a Chaos Wand battle.
mobbattle.panel.field.chaos.radius.hint = blocks
mobbattle.panel.field.chaos.maxmobs.label = Max mobs
mobbattle.panel.field.chaos.maxmobs.tip = Most mobs one Chaos Wand click affects.
mobbattle.panel.field.chaos.maxmobs.hint = more than {warn} can lag the server
mobbattle.panel.field.chaos.area.color.label = Area color
mobbattle.panel.field.chaos.area.color.tip = Palette color or random.
mobbattle.panel.field.chaos.height.label = Area height
mobbattle.panel.field.chaos.height.tip = Height of the area pillars and wall.
mobbattle.panel.field.chaos.height.hint = blocks
mobbattle.panel.field.chaos.area.onlywand.label = Area only while holding the wand
mobbattle.panel.field.chaos.area.onlywand.tip = Only its owner sees the area, and only while holding the Chaos Wand.
mobbattle.panel.field.team.fx.label = Team look
mobbattle.panel.field.team.fx.tip = Tint, mist, both or nothing on team mobs.
mobbattle.panel.field.team.fx.seconds.label = Team look time
mobbattle.panel.field.team.fx.seconds.tip = How long the team look stays after a mob joins a team.
mobbattle.panel.field.team.fx.seconds.hint = seconds, 0 = while in the team
mobbattle.panel.field.team.fx.onlywand.label = Team look only with the Team Wand
mobbattle.panel.field.team.fx.onlywand.tip = Show it only to the owner holding the Team Wand.
mobbattle.panel.field.army.tint.label = Army tint
mobbattle.panel.field.army.tint.tip = Army mobs wear a tint for as long as they are in your army (default off).
mobbattle.panel.field.army.tint.color.label = Army tint color
mobbattle.panel.field.army.tint.color.tip = Color of the army tint (default blue).
mobbattle.panel.field.army.friendlyfire.label = Army friendly fire
mobbattle.panel.field.army.friendlyfire.tip = Hits between mobs of one army (and its owner or leader) do damage, but nobody fights back: they stay allies (default off).
mobbattle.panel.field.fx.crown.label = Crown on the lone target
mobbattle.panel.field.fx.crown.tip = Gold, a palette color or off.
mobbattle.panel.field.wand.cleanse.color.label = Cleanse Wand color
mobbattle.panel.field.wand.cleanse.color.tip = Light and look of the Cleanse Wand.
mobbattle.panel.field.fx.glow.look.label = Look glow
mobbattle.panel.field.fx.glow.look.tip = Light around mobs with a jade or shimmer look or the buff's shimmer, in the look's color.
mobbattle.panel.field.fx.glow.look.hint = light level 0-15, 0 = off
mobbattle.panel.field.wave.summon.label = Summon wave
mobbattle.panel.field.glow.summon.label = Summon border
