mobbattle.panel.field.glow.slam.label = Slam border
mobbattle.panel.field.wave.allvsone.label = All vs one wave
mobbattle.panel.field.glow.allvsone.label = All vs one border
mobbattle.panel.field.wave.royale.label = Royale wave
mobbattle.panel.field.glow.royale.label = Royale border
mobbattle.panel.field.wave.tip = Shockwave color when it happens (off = none).
mobbattle.panel.field.glow.tip = Border glow color of its area (area = the area color).
mobbattle.panel.field.glow.summon.tip = Border glow color of its area (area = the area color). Also the color of the rune each summon rises from.
mobbattle.panel.field.mobfx.duel.label = Duel fighters
mobbattle.panel.field.mobfx.allvsone.label = All vs one target
mobbattle.panel.field.mobfx.attackers.label = All vs one attackers
mobbattle.panel.field.mobfx.royale.label = Royale fighters
mobbattle.panel.field.mobfx.tip = Mark on these mobs at the start (default = its own look).
mobbattle.panel.field.buff.unit.label = Buff values as
mobbattle.panel.field.buff.unit.tip = percent: +100 = double (default). multiplier: x2 = double, decimals allowed (x1.5); defense x2 = takes half the damage. Only how values are shown and typed: the buffs stay the same. Sources and clicks still add up (two x2 = x3, five clicks of x1.1 = x1.5).
mobbattle.panel.field.buff.size.speed.label = Speed from size
mobbattle.panel.field.buff.size.speed.tip = How much a size buff speeds up. natural (default): x4 = twice as fast, realistic. strong: x4 = 2.8x. full: x4 = 4x, the steps match the ground but it is very fast. off: no change.
mobbattle.panel.field.buff.size.jump.label = Jump from size
mobbattle.panel.field.buff.size.jump.tip = How much a size buff raises the jump. natural (default): the jump height grows with the size. strong / full: higher. off: no change.
mobbattle.panel.field.buff.size.max.label = Size limit
mobbattle.panel.field.buff.size.max.tip = Most extra size on one mob or player, all buffs together. Above +{size}% (x3) is not recommended: big players don't fit under roofs and their camera ends up in blocks; runes and crowns can sink into big heads.
mobbattle.panel.field.buff.stat.size.label = Size
mobbattle.panel.field.buff.stat.size.tip = Extra size for this source.
mobbattle.panel.field.buff.stat.health.label = Health
mobbattle.panel.field.buff.stat.health.tip = Extra health for this source.
mobbattle.panel.field.buff.stat.damage.label = Damage
mobbattle.panel.field.buff.stat.damage.tip = Extra damage for this source.
mobbattle.panel.field.buff.stat.defense.label = Defense
mobbattle.panel.field.buff.stat.defense.tip = Extra defense for this source.
mobbattle.panel.field.buff.stat.speed.label = Speed
mobbattle.panel.field.buff.stat.speed.tip = Extra speed for this source.
mobbattle.panel.field.buff.heal.label = Heal when given
mobbattle.panel.field.buff.heal.tip = Fill the new max health when the buff is given.
mobbattle.panel.field.buff.streak.maxkills.label = Streak max kills
mobbattle.panel.field.buff.streak.maxkills.tip = Kills that count at most for the streak buff.
mobbattle.panel.field.buff.streak.maxkills.hint = kills
mobbattle.panel.field.buff.wand.maxstacks.label = Buff Wand max stacks
mobbattle.panel.field.buff.wand.maxstacks.tip = Most Buff Wand clicks on one mob.
mobbattle.panel.field.buff.wand.maxstacks.hint = clicks
mobbattle.panel.field.wand.buff.color.label = Buff color
mobbattle.panel.field.wand.buff.color.tip = Buff Wand mark and swirl, and the shimmer of buffed mobs (default purple).
mobbattle.panel.field.wand.buff.look.label = Buffed mob look
mobbattle.panel.field.wand.buff.look.tip = While the buff lasts: shimmer (veins, eye flames and runes, default), runes (only eye flames and runes) or off.
mobbattle.panel.field.wand.buff.light.label = Buff Wand light
mobbattle.panel.field.wand.buff.light.tip = Light from the sky that brings the buff: buff = in the buff color (default), a color, or off (the buff lands at once).
