mobbattle.panel.note.cameras = Crouch, or /mobbattle skipCamera, skips a running camera. /mobbattle watch spectates a running battle (right click = next fighter, left = previous, Q or /mobbattle watch exit = exit).
mobbattle.panel.note.battlewaves = The waves of the Snap Wand (without a battle), the battle royale and all vs one.
mobbattle.panel.note.ties = Two different ties: who WINS when sides are even at time up, and in which ORDER fighters with the same kills are listed. Each battle tab can change them for its own battles.
mobbattle.panel.note.kindtab = Presentation and cameras: Global = the value on the Presentation / Cameras tabs (number fields: leave empty).
mobbattle.panel.note.buffs = Per source; sources add up on a mob. Buff Wand per click, streak per kill (up to Max kills).
mobbattle.panel.note.wandwaves = The held-click waves of the Morph, Cleanse, Effect and Heal wands.
mobbattle.panel.note.snapwave = Snap wave (dust when the ring arrives, ground only): Battles page, Battle waves.
mobbattle.panel.note.morphmodel = Right click a mob with the Morph Wand copies its model instead. Cleanse Wand or Admin > Undo morphs restore them.
mobbattle.panel.note.teamnames = Names: letters, numbers and _ (up to 16). There are always at least 2 teams.
mobbattle.panel.note.nogallery = No mobs in your teams yet: Team Wand (left click a mob), or Tools > Auto teams.
mobbattle.panel.note.summonempty = The list is empty: add mobs below or with the Summon Wand (right click a mob).
mobbattle.panel.note.builtin = Default: everything back to default. Fight: no show, just the fights. Effects: countdown, timer, titles, music, lasers, runes. Debug: everything visible (the debug log stays as it is). Cinematic: full camera work, no lasers or area drawings.
mobbattle.panel.note.nopresets = No saved presets yet.
mobbattle.panel.note.presetclick = Click a preset's name to load it into the form.
mobbattle.panel.note.presetholds = A preset holds every setting except the team list, the summon list and the permission mode.
mobbattle.panel.note.permissions = open = anyone can use the wands and change settings. server = needs dackoro.mob_battle.use / .config grants. Admin actions always need dackoro.mob_battle.admin.
