mobbattle.limits.maxmobs = Warning: more than {warn} mobs can lag the server (AI and pathfinding); thousands can freeze it. Your call.
mobbattle.limits.summoncount = Warning: random counts above {warn} can lag the server; each summon still stops at Max mobs.
mobbattle.limits.radius = Warning: a radius above {warn} blocks reaches past the view distance, where chunks aren't loaded and those mobs don't count; each click also searches a much bigger sphere, and the wave on the ground doesn't reach that far.
mobbattle.limits.arena = Warning: arenas above {warn} blocks redraw a long border every 250 ms (more particles to send) and the orbit camera ends up too far to see anything.
mobbattle.limits.height = Warning: walls above {warn} blocks send many more particles while they show.
mobbattle.limits.summonradius = Warning: a summon ring above {warn} blocks spreads mobs out of sight and its ring is hard to see.
mobbattle.limits.cameratime = Warning: cameras longer than {warn} s keep the viewers locked out of their controls that long (crouch or /mobbattle skipCamera cuts them).
mobbattle.limits.speed = Warning: a speed buff above +{warn}% (x4) makes players rubber-band (the client corrects them) and mobs can slip through corners.
mobbattle.panel.note.buffwand.stack = Each click adds to the mob's base value, it never multiplies what it already has. With x2 (+100%) per click, a mob with 10 health has 20 after one click, 30 after two and 60 after five (not 20, 40, 80). Every buff source adds up the same way. Defense is the share of damage blocked: x2 = takes half; two x2 clicks would block it all, so it stops at x100 (takes 1/100).
